{
  "title": "Drums Practice",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Read the chart, play",
        "the pads, watch your",
        "timing.",
        "",
        "Header: +3 s12 is",
        "3ms late, a spread",
        "of 12. Narrow is",
        "good.",
        "",
        "The bar at the",
        "bottom fills as the",
        "drill goes,",
        "hits/misses beside",
        "it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The list",
      "lines": [
        "Continue  next step",
        "Path      the stages",
        "Practice  all drills",
        "Quiz      ear drills",
        "Progress  how far",
        "Settings  your setup",
        "",
        "CLICK opens, BACK",
        "goes up. MENU is",
        "help for the screen",
        "you are on,",
        "anywhere.",
        "",
        "A row shows your",
        "best clean speed:",
        "80%. A tick is",
        "learned, a ring",
        "played but not",
        "clean."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The sheet",
      "lines": [
        "SHIFT+CLICK on a row",
        "opens its options:",
        "",
        "I know this: skip",
        "I know it all: skip",
        "Undo skip",
        "Start the path here",
        "Test out: checkpoint",
        "Lessons",
        "Practise: Ladder",
        "Practise: Clock",
        "Settings...",
        "",
        "Only what fits the",
        "row is shown."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "PLAY   listen",
        "REC    practise,",
        "       scored",
        "The same button",
        "pauses; the other",
        "one switches.",
        "BACK   to the start,",
        "       then up",
        "",
        "A result: REC again,",
        "BACK to the start,",
        "CLICK the next",
        "drill. JOG back:",
        "look over the take",
        "as played. Only",
        "whole takes count."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Own pace (L0)",
      "lines": [
        "L0 is the whole",
        "groove, no clock.",
        "The bar stands",
        "still; arrows mark",
        "the next stack.",
        "",
        "Strike its drums,",
        "and only those,",
        "TOGETHER (60ms on",
        "normal) and the",
        "arrows move on.",
        "",
        "PLAY   hear the bar",
        "REC    begin, pause",
        "Learned: 90% right",
        "first time. The % is",
        "your pace, of the",
        "tempo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs",
      "lines": [
        "In a drill:",
        "1  scrub, stopped",
        "8  speed, 50-120%",
        "",
        "Speed slows any",
        "drill, grooves and",
        "rudiments too. The",
        "tempo you play is",
        "what is recorded.",
        "",
        "In settings the",
        "knobs are the rows",
        "on screen, four to a",
        "page. Elsewhere they",
        "do nothing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The pads",
      "lines": [
        "Left half is your",
        "left hand, right",
        "half your right, in",
        "every layout.",
        "",
        "Settings > Pads:",
        "MPC      the default",
        "Family   by family",
        "Centre   kick, snare",
        "         centred",
        "GM       Move's own",
        "Mirror   two-handed",
        "Custom   your own",
        "Sticking snare only",
        "Flip mirrors it.",
        "",
        "Pad map: every pad",
        "named. CLICK on a",
        "preset copies it to",
        "Custom; PAD picks,",
        "JOG sounds, KNOB 1",
        "both halves, BACK",
        "saves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Colours",
      "lines": [
        "green   you got it",
        "amber   right drum,",
        "        WRONG HAND",
        "azure   right drum,",
        "        wrong volume",
        "red     you missed",
        "yellow  your finger",
        "violet  now",
        "purple  coming up",
        "pulse   Study waits"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Study",
      "lines": [
        "Settings > Practice",
        "> Study stops the",
        "scroll ON a note you",
        "missed. The lane",
        "names it; Guide pads",
        "pulse it.",
        "",
        "One press carries",
        "on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scoring",
      "lines": [
        "Four things, counted",
        "apart, because each",
        "is fixed",
        "differently:",
        "",
        "timing   mean+spread",
        "drum     hit or miss",
        "hand     sticking",
        "dynamic  accent,",
        "         ghost"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accents",
      "lines": [
        "An accent is LOUDER",
        "than your own",
        "strokes: their",
        "median + Accent +",
        "(15). A ghost: the",
        "median - Ghost -",
        "(20).",
        "",
        "Hit everything hard",
        "and nothing stands",
        "out.",
        "",
        "Scored apart: dyn",
        "30%. A soft accent",
        "is never a wrong",
        "note."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Clean at tempo",
      "lines": [
        "A drill is learned",
        "when you play it",
        "CLEAN at its written",
        "tempo:",
        "",
        "90% of notes right -",
        "right drum and hand,",
        "no strays - and the",
        "spread inside the",
        "Strict window.",
        "",
        "Your % is the",
        "fastest clean take.",
        "100% earns the tick",
        "- not on Loose,",
        "Guide pads or Study."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Path",
      "lines": [
        "Seven stages, first",
        "beat to pro. In",
        "each: Lessons, Ear,",
        "Time, Hands,",
        "Grooves, Electives,",
        "and the Checkpoint",
        "last.",
        "",
        "Continue opens the",
        "next step. A step",
        "sets Speed to its",
        "target: 45/60 = best",
        "45%, the step asks",
        "60. Pass a stage's",
        "Checkpoint to move",
        "on.",
        "",
        "SHIFT+CLICK a stage:",
        "skip it, start the",
        "path there, or Test",
        "out: checkpoint.",
        "Settings > Path:",
        "tracks, styles,",
        "rungs, start,",
        "intros."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Review",
      "lines": [
        "What you learned",
        "comes back after 1,",
        "3, 7, 14 and 30",
        "days. Continue",
        "offers one review,",
        "then one new step.",
        "",
        "A clean take at",
        "tempo moves it",
        "further out; a slip",
        "brings it back",
        "tomorrow. Slow",
        "practice never",
        "counts as a slip,",
        "and your best never",
        "drops."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Progress",
      "lines": [
        "Overall and each",
        "track: drills",
        "learned, as a line",
        "along real time.",
        "",
        "Then every drill you",
        "played: CLICK for",
        "its takes' chart,",
        "the 100% line",
        "dotted, clean takes",
        "filled.",
        "",
        "In a chart the JOG",
        "goes on to the next."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The result",
      "lines": [
        "Big: the speed you",
        "played, % of",
        "written. Beside it:",
        "% right and the",
        "spread; the one that",
        "stopped it is",
        "inverted. Not clean:",
        "big is % right, and",
        "under it what cost",
        "the most. dyn 30%:",
        "how accents and",
        "ghosts sounded.",
        "",
        "JOG back: the take",
        "as you played it -",
        "rings hit, crosses",
        "missed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Ladder",
      "lines": [
        "SHIFT+CLICK a drill,",
        "Practise: Ladder.",
        "",
        "Starts at 70% of the",
        "drill's tempo and",
        "climbs through it.",
        "Play N bars clean",
        "and it goes up. Slip",
        "and the rung plays",
        "again; slip twice",
        "and it stops.",
        "",
        "Your score is the",
        "top clean tempo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Clock",
      "lines": [
        "SHIFT+CLICK a drill,",
        "Practise: Clock.",
        "",
        "The click plays for",
        "four bars, then",
        "stops and you keep",
        "time. Your drift",
        "shows live while it",
        "is silent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Quiz",
      "lines": [
        "Guess and Hear: drum",
        "- play the drum",
        "asked for.",
        "",
        "Pick: drum, Hear:",
        "subdivision and",
        "Pick: groove name",
        "what you heard.",
        "Their answers sit on",
        "the bottom row, one",
        "coloured pad each.",
        "Press it, or JOG and",
        "CLICK.",
        "",
        "REC is help; PLAY",
        "plays the question",
        "again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Settings",
      "lines": [
        "Path      what",
        "          Continue",
        "          offers",
        "Practice  tempo,",
        "          reading,",
        "          judging",
        "Sound     the click",
        "Pads      the layout",
        "MIDI      where hits",
        "          go",
        "Help      tips and",
        "          welcome",
        "",
        "SHIFT+CLICK in a",
        "drill: every",
        "setting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Latency",
      "lines": [
        "If every hit reads",
        "late by the same",
        "amount, that is your",
        "rig, not you.",
        "",
        "Settings > Sound >",
        "Latency takes it off",
        "every reading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sound",
      "lines": [
        "The module has its",
        "own kit and click.",
        "Nothing to set up.",
        "",
        "Settings > MIDI:",
        "MIDI out can send to",
        "a track or USB",
        "instead."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
